ational development"],"correctOption":1,"section":"Practice Examination"}},{"itemId":"57a0dd35-768c-5eaa-9899-18f0e8cefaa1","courseId":"40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009","kind":"cbt_question","questionId":"578fa589-ec5d-46db-bfb0-d2dc0c068b4a","sourceKey":"quiz:107","parentItemId":null,"revision":1,"payload":{"prompt":"The founder of the royal dynasties of Benin with a link with Ife was ________","options":["Ewuare","Lamurudu","Oranmiyan","Oba Ewedu"],"correctOption":2,"section":"Practice Examination"}},{"itemId":"e07ea537-92d2-5803-87f5-9f34e6704531","courseId":"40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009","kind":"cbt_question","questionId":"34f4fe0c-8c28-4464-9b3e-c0eee2ddca2e","sourceKey":"quiz:108","parentItemId":null,"revision":1,"payload":{"prompt":"Initially, the British adopted the attitude of ________ during the Nigerian Civil War.","options":["Direct support for Biafra","Indifference","Direct support for the Federal Government","Neutrality"],"correctOption":3,"section":"Practice Examination"}},{"itemId":"2926e8e5-b373-5251-9d8e-528ee26439e9","courseId":"40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009","kind":"cbt_question","questionId":"d2ad464d-2e3f-4b16-bc29-54ef5a29fb57","sourceKey":"quiz:109","parentItemId":null,"revision":1,"payload":{"prompt":"The following are processes involved in marriage ceremony amongst Nigerian communities except ________","options":["Payment of bride price","Traditional marriage","Slavery","Search for the bride"],"correctOption":2,"section":"Practice Examination"}},{"itemId":"b7bd01ef-e0b3-549d-9270-ce70ba50faad","courseId":"40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009","kind":"cbt_question","questionId":"bbabd8f9-ddf6-489f-a1da-00e5c930cd26","sourceKey":"quiz:11","parentItemId":null,"revision":1,"payload":{"prompt":"Which two ethnic groups are dominant in the North-West zone?","options":["Igbo and Ijaw","Hausa and Fulani","Yoruba and Edo","Kanuri and Jukun"],"correctOption":1,"section":"Ethno-Historical Survey"}},{"itemId":"acb8a546-5eed-58ba-8a48